---
// Phase 8 §5 — the handoff out of the Opening Journey. No new text (the
// cinematic chapter already ends on "Nourrir en profondeur."), no new
// engine: a single gradient panel from the Journey's dark ground toward
// the ivoire of the sections that follow. Scrolling through it is itself
// the "progressive" reveal — no scroll-linked JS needed.
//
// Phase 8.1: shortened from 46svh — human QA read the original height
// (combined with Benefits' own top padding) as a near-empty screen
// between the Journey and "Tout commence à la racine." This is a raccord,
// not a section: it should read as a beat, not a stop.
---

<div class="transition-breath" aria-hidden="true"></div>

<style>
  .transition-breath {
    height: 24svh;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--forest-deep) 0%, var(--ivoire) 100%);
  }
</style>
